                "message": "🐛 Make new litnotes with our template for every BibTeX entry type, never citar's\n\n- entries of a type the dialect lacks (@online, @thesis, @video) were read as missing, so citar's template was used\n- title uses editors and keeps organisations whole\n- existing note is visited; no entry or a failing create is an error\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBzRgz7HiCb4sPpKbk",
